  "title": "Bacon-Wrapped Bourbon-Marinated Salmon",
  "description": "This bacon-wrapped bourbon-marinated salmon recipe wraps salmon in bacon then grills it until crisp. This flavor-packed dish is perfect as an appetizer.",
